{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.20260507100600","title":"Agent-native infrastructure needs agent-legible sensors and actuators","desc":"Karpathy: banyak tooling masih human-native, sementara agent-native memerlukan docs, state, permissions, dan actuator yang bisa dipahami model.","updated":1778775926006,"created":1778126965316,"tags":["zettel","infrastructure","agentic-engineering","tooling"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.20260507100600","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"d1160a40fe29b6e52513828c3e4b3668","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260507100600","id":"zettel.20260507100600","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260507100600","id":"zettel.20260507100600","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.infrastructure","alias":"infrastructure","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.infrastructure"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260507100600","id":"zettel.20260507100600","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.agentic-engineering","alias":"agentic-engineering","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.agentic-engineering"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260507100600","id":"zettel.20260507100600","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.tooling","alias":"tooling","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.tooling"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260507100600","id":"zettel.20260507100600","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.youtube.andrej-karpathy-from-vibe-coding-to-agentic-engineering","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":3,"offset":643},"end":{"line":13,"column":76,"offset":716},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.youtube.andrej-karpathy-from-vibe-coding-to-agentic-engineering"}}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"agent-native-infrastructure-needs-agent-legible-sensors-and-actuators\">Agent-native infrastructure needs agent-legible sensors and actuators<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#agent-native-infrastructure-needs-agent-legible-sensors-and-actuators\"></a></h1>\n<p>Claim: Friksi agent bukan hanya di model, tetapi juga di lingkungan kerja yang masih ditulis untuk manusia; agent-native infrastructure membutuhkan sensors, actuators, permissions, dan state yang legible untuk agent.</p>\n<p>Evidence:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Karpathy: \"Everything is still fundamentally written for humans... What is the thing I should copy paste to my agent?\"</li>\n<li>Contoh deploy Menugen ke Vercel yang sulit karena harus menghubungkan layanan, settings, DNS, dan UI.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Why it matters:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Menarik perhatian ke sisi infrastructure dan tooling, bukan hanya model.</li>\n<li>Mendorong desain system yang mempertimbangkan agent sebagai first-class consumer.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See also:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.youtube.andrej-karpathy-from-vibe-coding-to-agentic-engineering\">Andrej Karpathy: From Vibe Coding to Agentic Engineering</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">infrastructure (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">agentic-engineering (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">tooling (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart",